*================================================================*
* Views Definition
* Subject : AUTHORITY-USER and LICENSE-FEE-SCHEDULE views
*================================================================*

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VAUTHORITY-ALL
* Desc : Full authority user view for maintenance
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VAUTHORITY-ALL OF AUTHORITY-USER
  AUTHORITY-USER-ID
  USER-CODE
  USER-NAME
  AUTHORITY-NAME
  AUTHORITY-LEVEL
  DEPARTMENT
  PHONE-NUMBER
  EMAIL-ADDRESS
  ACTIVE-STATUS
  LICENSE-TYPES-AUTHORISED

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VAUTHORITY-LOOKUP
* Desc : Used during approval to validate approver
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VAUTHORITY-LOOKUP OF AUTHORITY-USER
  AUTHORITY-USER-ID
  USER-CODE
  USER-NAME
  AUTHORITY-NAME
  AUTHORITY-LEVEL
  ACTIVE-STATUS
  LICENSE-TYPES-AUTHORISED

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VFEE-SCHEDULE-ALL
* Desc : Full fee schedule view
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VFEE-SCHEDULE-ALL OF LICENSE-FEE-SCHEDULE
  FEE-SCHEDULE-ID
  LICENSE-TYPE
  FEE-TYPE
  FEE-AMOUNT
  EFFECTIVE-DATE
  EXPIRY-DATE
  CURRENCY-CODE
  DESCRIPTION
  ACTIVE-STATUS

*----------------------------------------------------------------*
* VIEW: VFEE-LOOKUP
* Desc : Used during payment to retrieve applicable fee amount
*----------------------------------------------------------------*
VIEW: VFEE-LOOKUP OF LICENSE-FEE-SCHEDULE
  LICENSE-TYPE
  FEE-TYPE
  FEE-AMOUNT
  CURRENCY-CODE
  EFFECTIVE-DATE
  EXPIRY-DATE
  ACTIVE-STATUS
